## Step 4: Verify Your Repo Looks Clean

Your final repo should look like this:
```
Afrin111/Multibankgroup_automation   🔓 Public
├── 📁 src
├── 📁 test-output
├── 📄 .gitignore        ← newly added
├── 📄 README.md         ← auto renders below
├── 📄 pom.xml
└── 📄 testng.xml
```

